    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113590" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείρ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποχείριος</span>
			, <i>in the hands, under control,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				411
			</span></i>; mostly with a Verb, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρίαν ἀφείς
				τινι</span> having left me <i>in the power of, captive
			to,</i> another, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				495
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλάβετε . . Ἑλένην
			χειρίαν;</span> did you get her <i>into your power?</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				177
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. ἁλοῦσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ion</u>
					1257
				</span></i>
			 (troch.).</div>
